{% doc %}
  Menyelaraskan tampilan teaser form Klaviyo dengan referensi desain: kartu putih
  188x51 dengan thumbnail membulat di kiri, teks di tengah, dan tombol tutup di
  kanan.

  Klaviyo merender teaser lewat JS dengan inline style, jadi seluruh override di
  sini memakai `!important`. Selector memakai prefix class `kl-teaser-` dan
  atribut `data-testid`, karena suffix class Klaviyo (`kl-teaser-Xyfrw6`,
  `Teaser-pointer-kSCH8`) ber-hash dan bisa berubah setiap form dipublikasikan.

  Warna latar dan warna teks sengaja tidak dikunci di sini supaya tetap bisa
  diatur dari editor Klaviyo. Gambar thumbnail diambil dari `background-image`
  yang dipasang Klaviyo: layer aslinya digeser ke luar kanvas, lalu diwarisi
  pseudo-element `::before` agar sudutnya bisa dibulatkan.

  Di template landing page, teaser dipindah ke kiri-bawah dan diangkat agar tidak
  menimpa sticky CTA bar dan tombol WhatsApp mengambang.

  @example
  {% render 'klaviyo-teaser' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign kl_teaser_bottom = '20px'
  assign kl_teaser_on_lp = false

  if template.suffix == 'menopause-lp' or template.suffix == 'inside-out'
    assign kl_teaser_bottom = '96px'
    assign kl_teaser_on_lp = true
  endif
-%}

{% style %}
  div[class*='kl-teaser-'] {
    width: 188px !important;
    margin: 0 20px calc({{ kl_teaser_bottom }} + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)) 20px !important;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 14px rgb(16 24 16 / 16%)) !important;
  }

  {%- if kl_teaser_on_lp %}
    div[class*='kl-teaser-'] {
      right: auto !important;
      left: 0 !important;
    }
  {%- endif %}

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button'] {
    display: flex !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    justify-content: flex-start !important;
    min-height: 51px !important;
    padding: 7px 34px 7px 7px !important;
    border-radius: 10px !important;
    background-position: -9999px center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    gap: 12px !important;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button']::before {
    content: '' !important;
    display: block !important;
    flex: 0 0 auto !important;
    width: 36px !important;
    height: 36px !important;
    border-radius: 8px !important;
    background-image: inherit !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-size: cover !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button']:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgb(16 24 16 / 14%) !important;
    transform: translateY(-1px) !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button']:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentcolor !important;
    outline-offset: 2px !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button'] > * {
    overflow: hidden !important;
    flex: 1 1 auto !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button'] * {
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 15px !important;
    line-height: 1.2 !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > button.klaviyo-close-form {
    top: 50% !important;
    right: 12px !important;
    left: auto !important;
    width: 14px !important;
    height: 14px !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
    background: none !important;
    opacity: 0.55 !important;
    transform: translateY(-50%) !important;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > button.klaviyo-close-form:hover {
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }

  [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > button.klaviyo-close-form svg {
    display: block !important;
    width: 14px !important;
    height: 14px !important;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button'],
    [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > button.klaviyo-close-form {
      transition: none !important;
    }

    [data-testid='animated-teaser'] > span[role='button']:hover {
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
